{"title":"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad51abe8469e8be0682d7abfba2911b1954bb0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(2 \\cdot 4^{x^2-3x}\\right)^2 = 2^{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"160\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/5824816b04404f3a9e921df5c7a6040cf36ac3b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^{b})^{c} = a^{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"22\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/11603ab6c79a6a801063f7e1bb759c2250a7608a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b} \\times a^{c} = a^{b + c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"19\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1eaa3d6d2e0e5b035da198933c684d0aed3a5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\times 4^{x^{2} - 3x})^{2} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae95d5af8a59ec46113097cde11aa9283980ee06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\times (2^{2})^{x^{2} - 3x})^{2} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/523e56a9d89e798fd8cdae14a984acd4b56d7c35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\times 2^{2(x^{2} - 3x)})^{2} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c84e0e6cd283b1a5ab26cc47fda34261c7093f6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{1} \\times 2^{2x^{2} - 6x})^{2} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a11c022b999884a8c3724b17ab7fa449694a0fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{2x^{2} - 6x + 1})^{2} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/6126a650f34f310002ebfbb328279227cf0becf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2(2x^{2} - 6x + 1)} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f7d4099d94e420ac4d549371bdeac534c96212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4x^{2} - 12x + 2} = 2^{x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The bases are equal to each other and aren't <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4ea08931ee8519b936cd67bcf5a10a83ffacd6da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^{2} - 12x + 2 = x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac8b50e9399f52c0d2f0f7b33a92f1cc26ff07a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^{2} - 13x + 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e048530d0c470dbe826250603058dfc03f2fcdda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^{2} - 12x - x + 3 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8dd7fd79540dfdcdff4e86321cb15bf17e8509d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x(x - 3) - 1(x - 3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41a8dd7671fa9f5e4fd8ca4ba25ef6dfda16528.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4x - 1)(x - 3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We see that this works for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/e/fee12f4af29929ce944784f04c99eb135814e449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b193a0894d71a4e829f24468fb3ff365313ccc67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a787081f13574b1ae9a52b75e149fa7f93d7f5d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = \\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf82c45c1241a963ba5e2b4d74780dfa225daa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />. Plugging these into the original left-hand side and right-hand side, we find that both of these solutions work out.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC\" title=\"2015 CSMC\">2015 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018060746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 133/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4463/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.124      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.124      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37303:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018060746 and revision id 287973. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}